  mText: 'Good morning!

    

    My boyfriend loves tea and I want to surprise
    him with a drink !

    He is a sweet and easy person who likes subtle flavors
    and fruits ! I want to make him relax and feel fresh, can you make him a tea
    for that please ?

    

    I would like it for the day after tomorrow, if
    possible.'
